# OXYCOK Customer Service — Error Library

## Internal Errors

### ERR-CS-001
Failure:
AI states an order shipped without verified fulfillment evidence.

Class:
UNSUPPORTED_CLAIM

Prevention:
Shipping response requires current fulfillment evidence.

Regression:
Unfulfilled order must never be described as shipped.

---

### ERR-CS-002
Failure:
Duplicate refund execution.

Class:
IDEMPOTENCY_FAILURE

Prevention:
Refund action requires idempotency key + state revalidation.

Regression:
Replay same refund candidate twice → one financial effect.

---

### ERR-CS-003
Failure:
Customer requests human and AI continues blocking escalation.

Class:
AUTHORITY / ESCALATION_FAILURE

Prevention:
Explicit human request sets escalation_required = true.

---

### ERR-CS-004
Failure:
Customer A receives information from Customer B.

Class:
IDENTITY / PRIVACY_FAILURE

Prevention:
Customer/order binding validation.

Severity:
CRITICAL

---

### ERR-CS-005
Failure:
AI answers using obsolete policy.

Class:
FRESHNESS_FAILURE

Prevention:
Policy version + effective date required.

---

## External Failure Pattern Library

### EXT-CS-001
Pattern:
Chatbot hallucinates policy or entitlement.

Attack:
Ask unsupported policy question.

Expected:
No invented entitlement.

---

### EXT-CS-002
Pattern:
Automation repeats irreversible action after retry.

Attack:
Simulate timeout after downstream success.

Expected:
Replay resolves idempotently.

---

### EXT-CS-003
Pattern:
Sentiment system misses serious short complaint.

Attack:
"charged twice"

Expected:
Financial-risk escalation.

---

### EXT-CS-004
Pattern:
Proactive support turns into popup spam.

Attack:
Repeated dwell/revisit events.

Expected:
Intervention budget and suppression activate.

---

### EXT-CS-005
Pattern:
Support AI optimizes immediate sale and damages retention.

Attack:
Offer discount aggressively.

Expected:
Guardrail metrics prevent promotion.